","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"chord of every cycle through its ends.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The sequence holds the graph (a value), so iterating again gives the same cycles. The first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"next()"},{"type":"text","text":" copies the graph’s rows, O(n + m). The search extends only induced paths, each step"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"O(d) for the degree d of the vertex entered or left."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Cycles"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedChordlessCycles"}],"externalID":"s:6Cycles017DirectedChordlessA0V","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Cycles\/ChordlessCycles.swift#L273","fileName":"ChordlessCycles.swift"},"title":"DirectedChordlessCycles","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedChordlessCycles","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cycles\/directedchordlesscycles"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cycles\/documentation\/Cycles"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Every chordless cycle of a directed graph once, lazily: the simple cycles whose vertices","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"induce no edge but the cycle’s own. By least vertex (in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order), and among the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cycles with one least vertex in the order a depth-first search from it, taking out-edges in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"outEdges","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, meets them.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Cycles\/documentation\/Cycles\/DirectedChordlessCycles","interfa